    - target: {fileID: 120359041554917552, guid: 203484d5888c16e46a9930e46ad0bbaf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: noteText
      value: "You\u2019ve finally made it here. The fact that you can see this means
        you\u2019ve come further than most.\n\r\nThere are two paths ahead of you:
        you can choose to go down or up. No one knows what lies at the end of either
        path. Good luck.\n\r\nStand on the corresponding spot and press E."
